{"time": 1755673008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157876185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056564993", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "她眼睛滴溜溜的转了两圈“那要是在此期间，你的敌人追过来了怎么办”"}
{"time": 1755673017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816723415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056564993", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“那鱼缸可是很珍贵的，被打碎了多可惜”"}
{"time": 1755673155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "273761584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056564993", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "“我们并未与任何一人为敌，更何况现在禁止开战，在监视者面前，真的会有人罔顾您的面子恶意开战吗”"}
{"time": 1755673182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370004725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056564993", "user_id": "1067041556"}, "sender": {"id": "1067041556", "name": "虚幻过往"}, "message": "“追过来和我们打一架，不是您想看到的吗？”"}
